WEBVTT

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:31.388
and he said, "Kneel."

00:11:31.388 --> 00:11:34.188
And these huge soldiers

00:11:34.188 --> 00:11:36.821
with their backpacks and their body armor,

00:11:36.821 --> 00:11:41.295
wobbled to the ground.

00:11:41.295 --> 00:11:47.380
And complete silence fell.

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:49.938
And after about two minutes,

00:11:49.938 --> 00:11:54.214
everybody moved aside and went home.

00:11:54.214 --> 00:11:59.696
Now that to me is wisdom in action.

00:11:59.696 --> 00:12:03.862
In the moment, that's what he did.